{"obsah":"<p>The charity festival on the riverside in Kostelec nad Orlicí was incredibly lucky. Not only did the guys ride there, but above all, on a totally rainy day it didn't rain until the end of our exhibition. A wall of water the whole way, and sunshine only on the riverside, which ended with the end of the exhibition – and even then it continued only with light drizzle. </p>\n\n<p>After arriving, Vlasta and Lukáš managed to park in the slightly cramped space, get the obstacles out and jump straight into the exhibition. There were plenty of people and they cheered like crazy, so a few bigger jumps came out, maybe right on the edge. By the time we got to the volunteers it started to drizzle lightly, but everything was handled without interruption. Thanks for the invitation.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2F514255075_1227505429418382_6426194827542828964_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2F514255075_1227505429418382_6426194827542828964_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250962\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2F514267578_1227506436084948_6223208743589174797_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F08%2F514267578_1227506436084948_6223208743589174797_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250964\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2